k we played him but i can't really  name receivers that he was that he had i  can't uh i can't remember and uh  uh really i think his best weapon was  mccoy shady mccoy so uh he hasn't had  the weapons i think that he has now with  the chargers so i'm excited to see what  he can do with him yeah i think he's 26  and 23 as a starter took the bills to  the playoffs the year they lost the  jaguars in a close game the year the  jaguars almost beat the patriots for a  berth in the super bowl so there's  something there with tyrod and you guys  got some weapons on offense and you know  those guys well too keenan allen and  mike williams it's not and hunter henry  it's not going to be easy uh for  defenses to slow those guys down and  tyrod's good enough that he can get him  the football  yes he is and um i mean  like like you said man just be able to  orchestrate the football let those guys  do what they do  let echoler do what he do keenan he's  going to get open he's one of the best  route runners in the nfl so i just know  just competing versus those guys they  they they have it um to be able to to  make those plays man it's just getting  over that huh well chris we hope we get  to see it i said over the weekend i was  told the nfl is very optimistic the  season will be played there may not be  fans but we'll be watching and we wish  you all the best as you start your first  season with the la charges  congratulations on our success all the  best your family happy father's day a  day late and we look forward to talking  to you again down the road  oh yeah no problem man thanks for having  me  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports
 

